    </tr>
            </tbody>

          </table>

        </div>

      </div>

      <p class="footnote">
        Testing coverage is calculated using the ROOT HEALTH NSCLC cohort as the denominator.
        Some patients may have undergone repeated testing or multiple testing modalities;
        therefore, the number of tests performed may exceed the number of patients tested.
      </p>

      <a href="data.html" class="back-link">
        <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i>
        Back to Data
      </a>

    </div>

  </section>

</main>
